    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveTowardsObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectWithinReach? THEN\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO ObjectPropertiesCheck\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\t\t\tDO ScanArea\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
